  "body_html": "<article class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-12 @md:gap-16 mt-10\"><div class=\"@container w-full max-w-container @md:shaded-container:px-0!\"><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"--hero-aspect-ratio:16/9;--hero-aspect-ratio-mobile:3/4\"><div class=\"@container w-full multi-columns:px-0 @md:shaded-container:px-0! toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\" data-section-header=\"true\"><div class=\"col-span-full col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-10 @md:col-start-2 @lg:col-span-8 @lg:col-start-3\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"meta\"><p class=\"text-meta text-primary-100\">November 6, 2026</p><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-meta text-primary-60 hover:text-primary-100\" href=\"/news/security/\">Security</a></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"text-h1 toc-collision-target max-w-250 text-primary-100 text-balance scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"headline\">Partnering with Hacktron to find vulnerabilities in OpenAI’s systems</h1></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div class=\"contents\"><div class=\"contents\"><div class=\"toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] @md:w-full article-actions-spacing pt-20 w-full\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 flex w-full flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-3 border-t border-t-primary-4 pt-3\" data-article-hero-actions=\"true\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"support\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 ms-auto\"><div class=\"relative\"><div aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" data-state=\"closed\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-cta\"><button class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3em] text-cta focus:outline outline-offset-2 h-[2.5rem] text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 disabled:text-primary-44 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-primary-44 px-0 !rounded\" type=\"button\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"17\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.52 7.62a.875.875 0 0 1 1.244 1.232L4.67 9.957l-.003.003c-1.384 1.385-1.421 3.658.147 5.227 1.568 1.568 3.842 1.531 5.227.147l.002-.002 1.107-1.095a.875.875 0 0 1 1.231 1.243l-1.106 1.096c-2.105 2.1-5.485 2.062-7.698-.152s-2.251-5.592-.15-7.697z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M11.881 6.881A.876.876 0 0 1 13.12 8.12l-5 5a.876.876 0 0 1-1.24-1.24z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M8.726 3.425c2.105-2.1 5.485-2.063 7.698.15s2.252 5.594.15 7.699L15.48 12.38a.875.875 0 0 1-1.244-1.231l1.095-1.107.003-.002c1.384-1.385 1.421-3.659-.147-5.227s-3.842-1.53-5.227-.147l-.003.003-1.106 1.095a.876.876 0 0 1-1.23-1.244z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path></svg>Share</button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"contents\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Today we’re announcing a partnership with Hacktron to find vulnerabilities in OpenAI’s systems. Our engineers and Hacktron’s security researchers will choose high-priority areas to test together, with a focus on how our systems interact with third-party services. As part of the partnership, we’re expanding Hacktron’s access to our frontier models through </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"/index/expanding-daybreak-as-the-cyber-defense-window-narrows/\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>Daybreak Red</span></u></a><span>.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>As we work to accelerate cyber defense with frontier AI, we’re applying the same urgency to finding and fixing vulnerabilities in our own systems. Earlier this week, we announced that </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"/index/preparing-our-next-security-sprint-to-harden-openai/\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>Cathedral’s researchers will work alongside our teams in our next security sprint</span></u></a><span>. We also </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"/index/rewarding-defenders-with-bigger-bug-bounties/\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>raised our bug bounty rewards</span></u></a><span> to give independent researchers more reason to pursue vulnerabilities our own testing may have missed.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>We became familiar with Hacktron through our Security Bug Bounty program and were impressed by the impact of the vulnerabilities its researchers have discovered and disclosed to us. The team builds AI agents for code review, penetration testing, and red teaming. Their </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://www.hacktron.ai/blog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>research</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> has uncovered vulnerabilities in how applications, cloud infrastructure, and identity systems interact. Their work shows what’s possible when security engineers build around AI to move faster and take on more ambitious research.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>As AI agents connect services in new ways, that combination of skills becomes even more valuable. Working alongside Hacktron will help us test those connections more deeply and use what we learn to strengthen our defenses.</span></p></div><div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\"><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-carousel-view\"><div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)] px-6 py-8\"><div class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth overflow-visible\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-scroll-region\"><div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 grid w-full\"><figure class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>The future of cybersecurity won’t be defined by who has the largest security team, but by who can best combine human creativity with AI-driven capabilities.<br/><br/></span><span>OpenAI is setting a strong example by putting frontier cyber models in the hands of security researchers, enabling them to uncover complex vulnerabilities at the boundaries between interconnected systems.<br/><br/></span><span>We’re excited to deepen our partnership with OpenAI, combining our offensive security expertise with their frontier models to help secure OpenAI and the broader software ecosystem.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><span>Zayne Zhang, CEO, Hacktron</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>We’re grateful to Hacktron and other independent researchers who put time into finding and reporting weaknesses to help strengthen the security that protects all our users. To see which systems are in scope or submit a finding, visit our </span><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" href=\"https://bugcrowd.com/engagements/openai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>Security Bug Bounty program</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span>.</span></p></div></div></div><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full scroll-mt-anchor-offset\" data-testid=\"citations\" id=\"citations\"><div class=\"rounded-md bg-primary-4 py-8 md:py-16 toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 px-5 @md:px-0 col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><section class=\"w-full\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><li><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block rounded-xl bg-primary-4 px-3 py-2! text-nav hover:bg-primary-12\" href=\"/news/?tags=2026\">2026</a></li><li><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block rounded-xl bg-primary-4 px-3 py-2! text-nav hover:bg-primary-12\" href=\"/news/?tags=cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></li></ul></section><div data-testid=\"author-list\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-p2 text-primary-60\">Author</h2><div class=\"text-p2\">OpenAI</div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"@container w-full\"><div class=\"max-w-container mb-8 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><div><h2 class=\"text-h4 text-primary-100\">Keep reading</h2></div><a class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3em] text-cta focus:outline outline-offset-2 h-[2.5rem] min-h-0 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 disabled:text-primary-44 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-primary-44 px-0 !rounded\" href=\"/news/\">View all</a></div><div class=\"@lg:max-w-container flex w-auto\"><div class=\"w-full toc-collision-target no-scrollbar snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden\"><div class=\"@md:gap-6 flex min-w-4xl px-6 pe-6 @md:min-w-[unset] @md:px-8 @lg:px-0 grid flex-none grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"relative mb-8 @md:mb-0 snap-start ps-6 @md:ps-0 min-w-[calc(100%/3)] ps-0 last:me-0\"><div class=\"group relative\"><di